# Deep-link app paths. When the OS does not hand an https link to the installed
# app, the browser lands here and this interstitial reconstructs the
# alexandria:// URL. Status 200 keeps the original URL visible.
#
# These live here rather than in netlify.toml because Nitro's netlify-static
# preset appends its own catch-all to this file:
#
#   /* /404.html 404
#
# Netlify evaluates _redirects before netlify.toml, so rules kept only in the
# toml lost to that catch-all and every one of these paths returned a 404.
# Order within this file is what makes them work — they must precede it.
/guardian/*   /app-open.html   200
/course/*     /app-open.html   200
/classroom/*  /app-open.html   200
/open         /app-open.html   200
